                            (To get access to most of them, you need a GSuite account, which you can <a href="https://my.aegee.eu/pages/gsuite">request here</a>)
                            <ul>
                              <li><a href="https://oms.aegee.org">AEGEE Knowledge Management System</a> (the knowledge backbone of AEGEE)</li>
                              <li><a href="https://oms.aegee.org">Materials Database</a> (you can find all useful materials there, such as outlines of sessions, promotion materials and tips and tricks for your work as a board)</li>
                              <li><a href="https://my.aegee.eu/pages/mailing-lists">Mailing lists</a> (official communication channels of AEGEE-Europe which keep you updated)</li>
                              <li><a href="https://my.aegee.eu/events">Events Calendar</a> (all events happening in AEGEE for which your members and you can apply)</li>
                              <li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/aegeeans">AEGEEans</a> (Facebook group with the latest news in AEGEE)</li>
                              <li><a href="https://t.me/AEGEE_Europe">Telegram channel</a> (updates from AEGEE-Europe)</li>
                              <li><a href="https://www.aegee.org/the-aegeean/">The AEGEEan</a> (official online magazine)</li>
                            </ul>
                            <br>
                            Other useful links:
                            <ul>
                              <li><a href="https://my.aegee.eu/pages/network-commission">NetCom</a> - contact your NetCommie with any question. They can forward you to the relevant people or pages.</li>
                              <li><a href="https://my.aegee.eu/bodies">Contact details of all European bodies and Locals.</a></li>
                              <li><a href="https://my.aegee.eu/pages/helpdesk">Helpdesk</a> - for support for technical issues, suggestions on future implementations and other assistance</li>
                              <li><a href="https://my.aegee.eu">MyAEGEE</a> - how to manage members and how to add membership fee payments made</li>
                            </ul>
                          </div>
